Description: avcodec: share encoder frame packing conversion and payload writing
 .
 Adapt Mark Thompson’s AVStereo3D conversion proposal to current CBS
 structures and the NVENC/QSV payload interfaces. Extend its mapping
 through every defined H.264 packing and the HEVC subset, preserving
 frame identity independently of eye order.
 .
 Validate layouts before submission, emit at keyframes and changes,
 emit temporal packing for each picture, and cancel a departed layout.
 Reject late HEVC metadata where sequence constraints forbid the mark.
 The helper leaves unmarked or disabled streams untouched.
 .
 The unit test checks independent expected payload bytes, both orders,
 temporal identity, cadence, cancellation and explicit refusals.
 .
 Based on https://ffmpeg.org/pipermail/ffmpeg-devel/2019-October/250967.html
 .
 Co-authored-by: Mark Thompson
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, https://code.ffmpeg.org/danielcamposramos/FFmpeg/commit/e36025744c1d05ab393e27581ebccdd243be3cac
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-09

